<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission shall meet at least twice a month or as often as may be necessary for the performance of its functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
