<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
