<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
