<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who hinders or attempts to hinder any person from giving evidence before the Commission or by threats, deters or attempts to deter any person from giving such evidence commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
