<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who threatens, insults or injures any person for having given evidence, or on account of the evidence which the person has given before the Commission commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Giving false information to Commission"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/12/eng@> .
